parts:
{
  "prompt": "An artistic portrait of a person posing like a model on an infinite white background. The figure is imagined based on a friendly, curious personality, engaging in a thoughtful yet confident pose. The style is soft and artistic, with smooth lighting and subtle shadows. The person has a natural, approachable expression, dressed casually but stylishly. The art should feel expressive and elegant.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A friendly-looking man with a slight smile, wearing glasses and a blue t-shirt, but with noticeable hair loss (balding on top), standing against a neutral background. Natural lighting, realistic style.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A surreal, oniric and cinematic illustration of a young creative man, designed as a symbolic self-portrait. He stands confidently in a glowing white space, wearing streetwear clothes in black, gold, red and blue tones. Behind him, a large eagle with outspread wings radiates power. His right hand holds a glowing sun, and his left a shimmering moon. His face is expressive and artistic, with a dreamy gaze and a subtle smirk. His hair is a bit messy, as if blown by creative winds. Elements of technology and AI symbols float around him — like glowing lines and interface icons. The art style is a blend of Pixar and surreal concept art, with soft shadows, dramatic lighting and vibrant colors.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A realistic urban street scene in the late afternoon. Three cars are parked in a line: a white car in the back, a black SUV in the middle, and a black BMW in the front. The black SUV has aggressively reversed into the white car, visibly damaging it and pushing it slightly back. Then it moved forward, hitting and pushing the black BMW. The SUV is now parked at an angle, having used the space to finish a parallel parking maneuver, and is calmly exiting the scene. The camera is fixed. The lighting is natural, with warm late afternoon tones. Only the SUV has moved; the other cars are passively reacting to the impacts.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}
